  "text": "Hi Ricardo, this is Diane. I am in the new office now, and I send you a photo. The building is very big, but our floor is small. It is quiet here, and that is good for calls. There are eight desks and one meeting room. The window is big and the view is the water. I think you are going to like it. Talk to you soon.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a8_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi Ricardo, Paul here. One more thing about Miami. The beach is ten minutes from the office by car, and it is free. On Friday many people go there after work. It is not expensive to live near the office, but the traffic is bad at six. My advice: live near the water, not near the highway. See you soon.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a8_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
